      <p class="docs-step-desc">
        <strong style="color: var(--ui-color-text)"
          >What disappears when a source is missing.</strong
        >
        Atelier’s own entries show it. Every component with metadata has its
        purpose sentence in <code>docs-list</code>, and every one with a JSDoc
        has that text in <code>docs-show</code>; the showcase entry
        <code>showcase-kitchen-sink</code> has none, so <code>docs-list</code>
        prints a bare name, and its <code>docs-show</code> has no description
        and no Inputs block: only one snippet whose
        <code>imports: [KitchenSinkDemoComponent]</code> has no import line
        above it. The <code>cookbook</code> entry has no snippets at all:
        <code>docs-show</code> lists its stories by name and id and nothing
        else. We have not removed a JSDoc comment from a component to compare
        before and after; what is described here is what those entries currently
        return.
      </p>
